  "id": "peppered-shrimp-alfredo",
  "name": "Peppered Shrimp Alfredo",
  "subtitle": "Creamy shrimp pasta with sautéed vegetables and cayenne",
  "description": "Penne is tossed with shrimp, vegetables, Romano, and a creamy Alfredo sauce finished with parsley.",
